#: ../../source/hardware/nfc.rst:4 036251cdc03f438f989d3e41a6312672
msgid ""
"The ``NFC`` class controls the onboard ST25R3916 NFC reader. It selects "
"the I2C bus, pins, and frequency for the detected controller automatically "
"and supports ISO14443 Type A tag detection, MIFARE Classic block access, "
"and Type 2 page access."
msgstr ""
"``NFC`` 类用于控制板载 ST25R3916 NFC 读卡器。它会根据检测到的控制器自动选择 I2C 总线、引脚和频率，并支持 "
"ISO14443 Type A 标签检测、MIFARE Classic 块访问和 Type 2 页访问。"

#: ../../source/hardware/nfc.rst:8 1e4cc2860f56458687c0c2dcc5ed4c97
