#: ../../source/hardware/nfc.rst:42 1ec4da4ddc814a8db60b42bcac3c674b
msgid "API"
msgstr "API参考"

#: ../../source/hardware/nfc.rst:49 0e2057cb8e424f70b6de744c946087b8
msgid ""
"Create an NFC reader for the onboard ST25R3916. The reader selects the "
"controller's onboard NFC I2C bus, pins, and frequency; no bus or pin "
"configuration is required."
msgstr "为板载 ST25R3916 创建 NFC 读卡器。读卡器会选择控制器的板载 NFC I2C 总线、引脚和频率；无需配置总线或引脚。"

#: ../../source/hardware/nfc.rst:53 c7b443eeb7674bf1960ae12991419a66
msgid ""
"Except for initialization, this class provides the same reader API as "
":class:`unit.nfc.NFCUnit`, which documents the shared methods and "
"returned :class:`driver.nfc.Card` object."
msgstr ""
"除初始化方式外，此类提供与 :class:`unit.nfc.NFCUnit` 相同的读卡器 API；共享方法和返回的 "
":class:`driver.nfc.Card` 对象均在该类文档中说明。"
